# MedSync Health, Inc.
# New Employee Onboarding Checklist

## Pre-Start

- [ ] Offer letter signed
- [ ] Background check completed
- [ ] IT equipment ordered
- [ ] Email account created

## Day 1

- [ ] Welcome email sent
- [ ] Office tour completed
- [ ] IT equipment setup
- [ ] Benefits enrollment

## Week 1

- [ ] Meet with manager for 1:1
- [ ] Complete HR onboarding modules
- [ ] Set up 1:1s with team members
- [ ] Review company handbook

## Month 1

- [ ] Complete product training
- [ ] Shadow team members
- [ ] Set 30-60-90 day goals
- [ ] First performance check-in
